	(text "Manafish Controller"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 33.782 15.748 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
			)
		)
		(uuid "e2f1fd47-b7c2-47f4-9f12-95d42afbeed7")
	)
	(text "GPIO14 high = ESC power on (12 mA drive; IC16 LED ~6-12 mA via R31). Reset / default = off.\nStatic switch: only switch with the motors stopped. No current limit - the battery BMS protects.\nSoft start C46/D6/R32: ESC_PWR ramps in ~1.5 s typ, up to ~12 s worst case (min VOM1271 Isc, warm hull).\nFirmware: arm the ESCs / allow thrust only >= 15 s after switching on. Keep GPIO14 low for >= 5 s after\nMCU boot, after the battery is plugged in and after any off. Never restore ESC power automatically at boot.\nD7 clamps Q3 VGS >= -0.6 V (battery unplugged / thrusters windmilling while off). Gate ~8 V cold, 5-6 V hot:\nQ3 NTMFS5C404NLT1G ~0.6-0.8 mOhm cold, 1.0-1.5 mOhm hot. Bring-up: measure ESC idle + start-up tune current in the ramp."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 191.77 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f23f61b2-3c68-4dd1-a237-83efcddea5b8")
	)
